'''Reaper''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that could be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.7 Update|Version 2.0.7]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.3 Update|Version 7.3]] gains multi-hit and increases health, damage and attack animation length.

{{Cat Info
