|name3 = Judgment
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Reaper 999''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Judgment''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Reaper is a pretty standard [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] crowd-controller and could help against some early-game [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark enemies]] like [[Gory Dark]] or [[Doge Dark]], but his long recharge time means that he quickly becomes outclassed by units such as [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Cat Gunslinger]]. Still, if you don't have any other anti-Dark units to use in a stage like [[Attack on D-Cyclone (Expert)|Attack on D-Cyclone]], it doesn't hurt to add him in.

==='''True Form'''===
Judgment gains a pretty substantial increase in health and damage as well as Multi-Hit. Overall his stats are still pretty low, but a large stack of them could still deal some pretty good DPS. The main improvement he gets is Multi-Hit, which effectively boosts his chance to slow in an attack cycle to a respectable 64%. This would be pretty good, if [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] didn't exist, which makes his niche rather worthless. If you manage to get Judgment before Bomber though, he could still be a decent crowd-controller, especially when stacked.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

